From 6ba564d9e4d76672b56d2570259e6f931ac239ff Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 12:44:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD strict selected-agent slash command routing to keep
 provider commands out of chat prompts

Slash-prefixed provider commands need a separate backend path because Codex slash commands are session commands, not user prompts. The command chat detects command-shaped selected-agent slash text, routes it through the provider command hook, and leaves slash-space chat text on the normal send path.
